LiquidAI/phone-assistant-tools (https://huggingface.co/datasets/LiquidAI/phone-assistant-tools)
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  - data/eval_set.jsonl and data/lookalike_traps.json contain request text and gold
    calls from this dataset. The tool catalog and argument comparison kinds are
    downloaded from it at run time.

Liquid AI cookbook, "GRPO with TRL" notebook (https://github.com/Liquid4All/cookbook)
  - The system prompt in src/toolscale/prompt.py is reproduced from the notebook so
    that results are comparable with Liquid's evaluation setup.
  - src/toolscale/scoring.py follows the notebook's rules for comparing predicted and
    gold arguments, in an independent implementation.

Models are not included. LFM3-1.7B is downloaded from Hugging Face under the LFM Open
License v1.0, and MiniCPM5-2B under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
